          "quote": "没有连续两次到60以上"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was substantially completed before the final unanswered message: the doctor stated checked dangers, allowed residual vaccine/screening/echo/jaundice tasks with owners, and defined what would convert observation into urgent care.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
