          "quote": "任何一条出现就走"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was met: the trajectory repeatedly listed urgent thresholds including sustained tachypnea, cyanosis, grunting, retractions, poor feeding, abnormal temperature, lethargy, and worsening jaundice.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
