          "explanation": "The doctor also asked the caregiver to read specific unclear discharge/vaccine/screening items.",
          "quote": "逐字读给我听"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met: the doctor queried available records, requested discharge/echo/vaccine/screening details, and treated uncertain items as unresolved instead of assuming completion.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
