          "quote": "如果没有写，就不用吃"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 had a minor omission. The doctor checked for discharge medicines and said not to take medicine absent written instructions, but never explicitly warned the caregiver not to independently continue, purchase, inject, or restart inpatient antibiotics or injection medications such as vitamin K without clinician confirmation.",
